{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108150","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1510815001:0":{"text":"저, 저 루나애니들이... <style=\"highlight\">사냥의 신의 가호</style>를 얻었어요! 마치 힘이 넘쳐 흘러, 미쳐 날뛰는 짐승들 같다고요!","source_cn":"那、那些兽人……他们得到了<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C723065A1642D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510815002:0":{"text":"마법사님들... 멀린 님! 부디 저희를 도와주세요!","source_cn":"几位魔法师大人……梅林女士！求你们救救我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA68857A8B9256DFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1510815002":{"text":"마법사님들... 멀린 님! 부디 저희를 도와주세요!","source_cn":"几位魔法师大人……梅林女士！求你们救救我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA68857A8B9256DFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510815003:0":{"text":"여기서 뭐 하고 있는 것이냐?! 어서 무기를 들고 싸워라! 저 야만스러운 루나애니가 곧 최전선을 뚫고 올 거다!","source_cn":"你在这里做什么？！快拿起武器去战斗！那群野蛮的兽人要冲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CBCE8E85664B41D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510815004:0":{"text":"부관님, 이분들은 마법사이시니 저희를 도울 수 있을지도 모릅니다!","source_cn":"副将大人，这些人是魔法师，或许有办法救咱们的战友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1605A4D3655950A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510815005:0":{"text":"마법사는 무슨! 저들은 홍수를 일으킨 장본인들이다!","source_cn":"——狗屁魔法师！他们是引发洪水的罪魁祸首！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57BCB425D7513235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1510815005":{"text":"마법사는 무슨! 저들은 홍수를 일으킨 장본인들이다!","source_cn":"——狗屁魔法师！他们是引发洪水的罪魁祸首！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57BCB425D7513235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510815007:0":{"text":"병사들이여, 잘 들어라! 이 자들은 아쿠보르의 졸개이자, 보칼리스의 적이다!","source_cn":"士兵，听令！这些人是雅库伯尔的走狗，呼临的敌人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C59D490109C743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510815008:0":{"text":"포위하고 목을 베어, 이 자들도...","source_cn":"包围他们，割下他们的头！叫他们也尝尝——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF235665F468F72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510815009:0":{"text":"...조심해!","source_cn":"——小心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x150F39BFE98D0367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_